name roboto
category Package
revision 77682
shortdesc Support for the Roboto family of fonts
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Roboto Sans, Roboto Condensed, Roboto Mono,
longdesc Roboto Slab and Roboto Serif families of fonts, designed by
longdesc Christian Robertson and Greg Gazdowicz for Google.
